-- הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 15.10.2020: the special agreement between the State
-- and הסתדרות המורים that carries the colleges' corona arrangement of
-- 31.3.2020 (l4/agreements/teachers-general/2020-03-31_histadrut-hamorim_michlalot-covid-emergency.l4)
-- into the academic year תשפ"א, registered on 15.2.2021 (no. 368/2020).
-- Whom it covers (§10), as that agreement; its period, from the start of
-- תשפ"א at the institution to the start of תשפ"ב (§11); the year's duties go
-- on, and the institution may call a lecturer to teach on the campus on
-- three days' notice (§12); what cannot be done is done by the end of the
-- period (§13); the salary for the work actually done is unchanged (§14),
-- with nothing paid for the deferred duties (§15); reporting (§16) and the
-- reduction (§17); a follow-up committee that decides disputes (§§18–20);
-- exhaustion and industrial peace (§§23–26).
--
-- The circular תשפ"א/2 (l4/circulars/2020-21_tashpa_02.l4) carries it to the
-- owning bodies; it re-encodes the agreement's rules, from before this file
-- existed, and does not yet import it. It speaks to no pay item of
-- l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `2020-03-31_histadrut-hamorim_michlalot-covid-emergency`

-- not weighed against `the Annual Leave Law`: §13 has the academic duties
-- not done in the year תשפ"א completed by the end of the agreement's period
-- "notwithstanding any arrangement" on the lecturers' vacation dates, as
-- the institution directs; how many days, if any, they take from a
-- lecturer's leave turns on what is left undone and on each institution's
-- directions, and the colleges' vacation arrangement is outside the
-- corpus, so nothing here sets a day of leave the law could be weighed
-- against.

-- not weighed against `the Advance Notice Law`: §17 names the end of the
-- work relation with the institution only as when a reduction may be
-- deducted from the final settlement; it gives or asks no notice.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: §2 says the agreement speaks of
-- men and women alike, either gender meaning the other; nothing gives pay
-- or other remuneration by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 15.10.2020 — עובדי הוראה במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה בשנת הלימודים תשפ"א`

-- akn:preamble/p1 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15.2.2021, number 368/2020; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 The parties: the State, by the wages commissioner and the director-general ("the employers"), and הסתדרות המורים, by its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 Recitals: fighting the corona virus needed special instructions, and restrictions are imposed from time to time ("the restrictions").
-- akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 akn:preamble/p16 Recitals: the contracts cannot be kept as usual in the year תשפ"א; the parties keep public health and seek certainty of pay and the colleges' academic work.
-- akn:preamble/p17 A recital: the agreement of 31.3.2020 for semester B of תש"ף, which this one carries on (imported).
-- akn:preamble/p18 akn:preamble/p19 A recital: frontal teaching and exams are held in reduced attendance, and the parties settle the year תשפ"א here.
-- akn:preamble/p20 akn:preamble/p21 The parties set their understandings down here, and the words of agreement; no rule.
-- akn:art_1 akn:art_2 akn:art_3 akn:art_4 akn:art_5 akn:art_6 akn:art_8 Rules of interpretation (the preamble is part of it; headings, gender and number; a law, agreement or procedure as amended from time to time; naming one changes not its standing; drafts do not interpret it); no rule to compute.

-- ¶3: signed on 15 October 2020.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the colleges' corona agreement of 15.10.2020 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 10 2020

DECLARE `action of 15.10.2020` IS ONE OF
    `change the agreement of 15.10.2020, in writing`
    `carry out the academic duties of תשפ"א, of 15.10.2020`
    `teach on the campus, of 15.10.2020`
    `complete the deferred academic duties, of 15.10.2020`
    `report a duty prevented to the manager, of 15.10.2020`
    `reduce the consideration, of 15.10.2020`
    `decide a dispute over the agreement of 15.10.2020`
    `cooperate in carrying out the agreement of 15.10.2020`
    `support a claim at odds with the agreement of 15.10.2020`
    `negotiate further pay for the period of 15.10.2020`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 15.10.2020 settles`

-- §7: a change is made by the parties' consent, in writing only.
@ref akn:art_7
`changing the agreement of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MAY   `change the agreement of 15.10.2020, in writing`

§§ `9 הגדרות`

-- "מנהל": whom each institution names for this, as on 31.3.2020; "the
-- year תשפ"א": semester א', semester ב' and the summer semester of the
-- academic year 2020–2021.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9/p1
GIVEN `whom the institution named` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the manager of 15.10.2020` `whom the institution named` IS `the manager of 31.3.2020` `whom the institution named`

@ref akn:art_9/p2
`the semesters of the year תשפ"א, of 15.10.2020` MEANS LIST "סמסטר א'", "סמסטר ב'", "סמסטר קיץ"

§§ `10 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §10: whom it covers is word for word the agreement of 31.3.2020's §10:
-- that rule, imported; ¶3: for the position at the college only.
@ref akn:art_10/p1 akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_b akn:art_10/p2
GIVEN e IS A `college lecturer of 31.3.2020`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 15.10.2020 covers` e IF
    `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` e

@ref akn:art_10/p3
GIVEN e IS A `college lecturer of 31.3.2020`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position the agreement of 15.10.2020 governs` e IS
    `the position the agreement of 31.3.2020 governs` e

§§ `11 תקופת ההסכם ותוקפו`
    @ref akn:art_11/p1
    GIVEN `the start of the academic year תשפ"א at the institution` IS A DATE @desc the agreement names no day
          `the start of the academic year תשפ"ב` IS A DATE @desc the agreement names no day

-- §11: from the start of the year תשפ"א at the institution to the start of
-- the academic year תשפ"ב ("the agreement's period"). The agreement of
-- 31.3.2020 ran to the start of תשפ"א, so the two meet on that day.
@ref akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the period of 15.10.2020` d IF
        DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL `the start of the academic year תשפ"א at the institution`
    AND DATE_SERIAL d LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the start of the academic year תשפ"ב`

§§ `12–15 המשך פעילות אקדמית והתמורה`

-- §12: the lecturers go on with all the duties of the year תשפ"א, as on
-- 31.3.2020 for semester B; ¶2: the institution may hold part of the
-- teaching frontally on the campus, and the lecturer comes to teach there
-- on three days' notice, subject to the "purple badge" rules and the
-- Ministry of Health's updates.
@ref akn:art_12/p1
`carrying out the year's duties, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `carry out the academic duties of תשפ"א, of 15.10.2020`

@ref akn:art_12/p2
`the days' notice to teach on the campus, of 15.10.2020` MEANS 3

GIVEN `days since the institution's notice` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `must teach on the campus, of 15.10.2020` `days since the institution's notice` IF
    `days since the institution's notice` AT LEAST `the days' notice to teach on the campus, of 15.10.2020`

-- §13: notwithstanding any arrangement, agreement or custom on the
-- lecturers' vacation dates, at the institution now or on the eve of the
-- signing, duties that could not be done in the year are done in full by
-- the end of the period, as the institution directs.
@ref akn:art_13
`completing the deferred duties, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `complete the deferred academic duties, of 15.10.2020`

-- §14: the salary for the full performance of the year's duties does not
-- change, for the time actually worked in the year or part of it ("the
-- consideration"); reporting-dependent components are not in it. The rule
-- is the agreement of 31.3.2020's §14, imported.
@ref akn:art_14
GIVEN `salary for the work actually done in תשפ"א, reporting-dependent components aside` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the consideration of 15.10.2020` `salary for the work actually done in תשפ"א, reporting-dependent components aside` IS
    `the consideration of 31.3.2020` `salary for the work actually done in תשפ"א, reporting-dependent components aside`

-- §15: nothing beyond the consideration for the deferred duties, though
-- done when no teaching would have been held, or after the year.
@ref akn:art_15
GIVEN `pay claimed for the deferred duties` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for the deferred duties, of 15.10.2020` `pay claimed for the deferred duties` IS
    `pay for the deferred duties, of 31.3.2020` `pay claimed for the deferred duties`

§§ `16 דיווח`

@ref akn:art_16/p1
`reporting a prevented duty, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `report a duty prevented to the manager, of 15.10.2020`

§§ `17 ניכוי שכר`

-- §17: a lecturer the manager finds did not meet §12 or §13 (the corpus's
-- sic for "1212" and "1313") is not paid the whole consideration: the
-- reduction of 31.3.2020's §17, imported.
@ref akn:art_17/p1
GIVEN `the consideration due` IS A NUMBER
      `share of the §12 and §13 duties not done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the consideration of 15.10.2020 after a reduction` `the consideration due` `share of the §12 and §13 duties not done` IS
    `the consideration of 31.3.2020 after a reduction` `the consideration due` `share of the §12 and §13 duties not done`

`reducing the consideration, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `reduce the consideration, of 15.10.2020`

§§ `18–20 ועדת מעקב`

-- §18: a follow-up committee — the director-general, the wages
-- commissioner and the union's secretary-general — follows the agreement
-- and decides disputes over it; §19: by telephone or video too; §20: its
-- decisions are final and bind the parties.
@ref akn:art_18/p1 akn:art_19 akn:art_20
`deciding disputes, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MAY   `decide a dispute over the agreement of 15.10.2020`

`the follow-up committee's decisions of 15.10.2020 bind the parties` MEANS TRUE

§§ `21–26 שיתוף פעולה, אי תמיכה, מיצוי ושקט תעשייתי`

@ref akn:art_21/p1
`cooperating, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `cooperate in carrying out the agreement of 15.10.2020`

@ref akn:art_22/p1
`not supporting claims against the agreement of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `support a claim at odds with the agreement of 15.10.2020`

-- §23: it exhausts every claim for the period on what it settles; §24: no
-- further negotiation on pay for the period; §26: it takes nothing from
-- the exhaustion and peace clauses already binding.
@ref akn:art_23/p1 akn:art_24 akn:art_26
`negotiating further pay for the period, of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate further pay for the period of 15.10.2020`

@ref akn:art_25
`industrial peace of 15.10.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 15.10.2020 settles`

§§ `27–30 כללי`

-- §27: the understandings are one whole. §28: subject to every law, the
-- regulations under the corona special-powers law and the Public Health
-- Ordinance's orders among them. §29: on a conflict with an earlier
-- agreement, arrangement, procedure or custom, this agreement prevails.
-- §30: filed for registration as a special collective agreement.
@ref akn:art_27/p1 akn:art_28 akn:art_29 akn:art_30
`the agreement of 15.10.2020 prevails over an earlier arrangement` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:conclusions/p1 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/t1 The signing formula and the signatures; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' — כתב הצטרפות`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1/t1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7 The form of the accession letter, whose effect §10(ב) encodes; its blank date is this agreement's (the corpus's note); no rule of its own.

§§ `Worked examples`

#ASSERT `the agreement of 15.10.2020 covers` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement of 15.10.2020 covers` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the position the agreement of 15.10.2020 governs` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS 0.6
#ASSERT `the consideration of 15.10.2020 after a reduction` 10000 0.1 EQUALS 9000
#ASSERT `pay for the deferred duties, of 15.10.2020` 500 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT NOT `must teach on the campus, of 15.10.2020` 2
#ASSERT `must teach on the campus, of 15.10.2020` 3
